---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { PUBLIC_SITE_URL } from 'astro:env/client';

const seoTitle = 'Comegame Account Setup Guide: Registration, KYC & Security Tips for Indian Users';
const seoDescription =
	'Complete guide to setting up your Comegame account — step-by-step registration, KYC document requirements, security settings, 2FA, UPI linking, and common error fixes for Indian users.';
const canonicalUrl = `${PUBLIC_SITE_URL}/blog/comegame-account-setup-guide`;
const ogImage = `${PUBLIC_SITE_URL}/android-chrome-512x512.png`;
const keywordsMeta =
	'comegame account setup, comegame registration india, comegame KYC guide, comegame 2FA security, comegame profile setup, comegame UPI linking, online gaming account india, comegame login security';

const articleSchema = {
	'@context': 'https://schema.org',
	'@type': 'BlogPosting',
	headline: seoTitle,
	description: seoDescription,
	url: canonicalUrl,
	image: ogImage,
	datePublished: '2026-07-01',
	dateModified: '2026-07-01',
	inLanguage: 'en-IN',
	author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Come Game Guide' },
	publisher: {
		'@type': 'Organization',
		name: 'Come Game Guide',
		logo: { '@type': 'ImageObject', url: ogImage },
	},
	mainEntityOfPage: canonicalUrl,
};

const faqSchema = {
	'@context': 'https://schema.org',
	'@type': 'FAQPage',
	mainEntity: [
		{
			'@type': 'Question',
			name: 'What documents are needed to verify a Comegame account?',
			acceptedAnswer: {
				'@type': 'Answer',
				text: 'Standard KYC documents for Comegame include a government-issued photo ID (Aadhaar card, PAN card, passport, or voter ID) and a PAN card specifically for tax compliance purposes. Proof of address may also be required.',
			},
		},
		{
			'@type': 'Question',
			name: 'How long does Comegame KYC verification take?',
			acceptedAnswer: {
				'@type': 'Answer',
				text: 'KYC verification on Comegame typically takes a few hours to two business days. Submitting clear, well-lit photographs of documents and ensuring name consistency speeds up the process.',
			},
		},
		{
			'@type': 'Question',
			name: 'Can I use the same mobile number for multiple Comegame accounts?',
			acceptedAnswer: {
				'@type': 'Answer',
				text: 'No. Each mobile number can only be linked to one Comegame account. Creating multiple accounts with the same number is not possible, and creating multiple accounts with different numbers to claim multiple welcome bonuses is against the platform\'s terms and can result in account suspension.',
			},
		},
		{
			'@type': 'Question',
			name: 'What is two-factor authentication on Comegame?',
			acceptedAnswer: {
				'@type': 'Answer',
				text: 'Two-factor authentication (2FA) adds a second verification step to your login — typically an OTP sent to your registered mobile number. Even if someone knows your password, they cannot access your account without the OTP.',
			},
		},
		{
			'@type': 'Question',
			name: 'What should I do if my Comegame registration OTP is not received?',
			acceptedAnswer: {
				'@type': 'Answer',
				text: 'Wait 60 seconds and use the resend option. Ensure your mobile number is entered correctly and has network signal. If the problem persists, try a different network or contact Comegame support through the official contact page.',
			},
		},
	],
};
---

<Layout
	title={seoTitle}
	description={seoDescription}
	keywords={keywordsMeta}
	canonical={canonicalUrl}
	ogImage={ogImage}
>
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)}></script>
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)}></script>
	</Fragment>

	<article class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
		<header class="max-w-4xl">
			<a href="/blog" class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">
				Back to Blog
			</a>
			<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-5xl">
				Comegame Account Setup Guide: Registration, KYC &amp; Security Tips for Indian Users
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-muted-foreground">Published on July 1, 2026 | Account Setup &amp; Security Guide</p>
			<p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground md:text-lg">
				Setting up a Comegame account correctly from the start saves considerable trouble later. A properly
				completed registration — with verified identity, secure settings, and a correctly linked payment
				method — means faster withdrawals, no KYC-related blocks, and a well-protected account. This guide
				covers every step from the initial download to a fully secure, withdrawal-ready profile.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="mt-8 max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-5">
			<div class="grid items-center gap-4 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr]">
				<img src="/logo.svg" alt="Comegame account setup guide India" class="h-16 w-16 rounded-xl border border-border bg-background p-2" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
				<p class="text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
					This guide covers account creation through to full verification. If you are already registered and
					looking for game-specific guidance, visit the
					<a href="/come-games" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Come Games section</a>.
					For information on downloading the app safely before registration, see the
					<a href="/download-come-games-app" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Comegame app download guide</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<section class="mt-10 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Before You Register: Things to Have Ready</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Registration on Comegame is a quick process, but having certain items ready beforehand makes it
				seamless and prevents the need to restart or correct details later. Here is what to gather before
				you begin.
			</p>
			<ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Active Indian mobile number:</strong> Your mobile number is your
					primary identifier on the platform. Ensure the number is currently active and receiving SMS —
					you will need it for OTP verification during registration, login, and withdrawals. Use a number
					you have long-term access to; changing it later requires a formal account update process.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">PAN card details:</strong> PAN is mandatory for Indian gaming
					platforms because of TDS compliance requirements. Have your PAN number and a clear photograph
					of the physical card ready.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Aadhaar card:</strong> Used as proof of identity and address.
					Your Aadhaar name must match the name you use during registration exactly.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">UPI ID or bank account details:</strong> You will need these
					to link a payment method for deposits and withdrawals. Ensure the bank account or UPI ID is
					registered in your own name — third-party payment accounts will not pass verification.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Valid email address (if required):</strong> Some platforms
					require email alongside mobile registration. Use an address you regularly access, as
					important notifications and security alerts may be sent there.
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				The app itself should be downloaded from a verified source. Our
				<a href="/download-come-games-app" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Comegame app download guide</a>
				identifies the safest installation method and explains what permissions to accept during installation.
				Installing from unofficial APK sources is a significant security risk and should be avoided.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Step-by-Step Registration Process</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				The Comegame registration process follows a standard flow common to most Indian gaming platforms.
				Here is each step with specific guidance on what to enter and what to avoid.
			</p>
			<ol class="mt-5 list-decimal space-y-5 pl-6 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Open the app and tap "Register" or "Sign Up."</strong>
					You will be directed to the registration screen. Do not use a "Sign in with Google" option if
					you intend to use a specific mobile number as your primary identifier — the account details
					may differ.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Enter your mobile number.</strong>
					Double-check the number before tapping "Send OTP." An incorrect number means the OTP goes
					to someone else, and you will need to start over. Enter the number without the country code
					prefix unless the field explicitly asks for it.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Enter the OTP.</strong>
					The OTP is typically valid for 60–120 seconds. If it expires before you enter it, use the
					"Resend OTP" option. Do not share the OTP with anyone, including anyone claiming to be
					platform support.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Enter your full name.</strong>
					Use your legal name exactly as it appears on your Aadhaar card. Do not use nicknames,
					initials only, or abbreviated versions. A mismatch between your registration name and KYC
					documents will cause verification failure and block withdrawals later.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Set a strong password.</strong>
					Use a password that is at least 12 characters long, contains uppercase and lowercase letters,
					numbers, and a special character. Do not reuse a password you use on other platforms. See
					the password security section later in this guide for best practices.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Enter your date of birth.</strong>
					You must be at least 18 years old to register on Comegame. Enter your actual date of birth —
					it will be verified against your KYC documents.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Accept the Terms and Conditions.</strong>
					Read the key sections before accepting — particularly the sections on bonus terms, responsible
					gaming, and state-specific restrictions. Our
					<a href="/faq" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">FAQ page</a> summarises
					the most commonly asked questions about platform terms if you want a quicker reference.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Apply a referral code if applicable.</strong>
					If a friend referred you, enter their referral code during registration to claim the
					enhanced welcome offer. This field is usually only available during registration — you
					cannot add a referral code retroactively.
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">KYC Verification: What It Is and Why It Matters</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				KYC — Know Your Customer — is a regulatory requirement that Indian financial service providers and
				gaming platforms must comply with. It involves verifying that the person behind an account is who
				they say they are, is of legal age, and is not using the account for fraudulent purposes. For users,
				completed KYC unlocks the full functionality of the platform: specifically, the ability to withdraw
				winnings without holds or delays.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Many users delay KYC until they want to make their first withdrawal, at which point the verification
				process becomes an obstacle. The smarter approach is to complete KYC during your first week of use,
				before your balance is significant. This way, when you are ready to withdraw, the process is already
				complete.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Understanding the full lifecycle of money on the platform — from deposit through play to withdrawal —
				helps you understand why KYC is positioned where it is. Our
				<a href="/blog/comegame-withdrawal-guide" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Comegame withdrawal guide</a>
				explains how KYC status directly affects your ability to cash out and what to do if verification
				is taking longer than expected.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">KYC Document Requirements in Detail</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Comegame's KYC process accepts standard Indian identity and address documents. Here is a breakdown
				of each acceptable document type, what information it provides, and tips for submitting it correctly.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-5 space-y-5">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">PAN Card (Mandatory)</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						The Permanent Account Number card is required on all Indian gaming platforms for TDS compliance.
						Submit a clear photograph of both front and back. The name on the PAN card must match your
						account name. If you have a recently updated name (for example, after marriage), use an
						updated PAN card or an affidavit alongside an older document.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Aadhaar Card (Identity and Address)</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						Aadhaar serves dual purpose — it verifies both identity and address. Submit clear photographs
						of front and back. Ensure the name, date of birth, and address are clearly readable. If your
						Aadhaar shows an old address that does not match your current location, that is acceptable
						as long as the name and date of birth are accurate and consistent with your account details.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Passport (Alternative Identity Document)</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						Accepted as an alternative to Aadhaar. Submit the photo page and the page with your date of
						birth and nationality. Passports are particularly useful if your Aadhaar has outdated
						information that does not align with your current legal name.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Voter ID</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						Accepted on most platforms as both identity and address proof. Photograph front and back clearly.
						Voter ID is a good alternative if you have concerns about sharing your Aadhaar number online.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Tips for Document Photography</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						The single most common reason for KYC rejection is a blurry or poorly lit document photograph.
						Use the following checklist: photograph in good natural or artificial light without flash glare;
						place the document flat on a plain dark surface; hold the camera directly above (not at an angle);
						ensure all four corners of the document are visible; verify the text is legible when you zoom
						into the preview before submitting. Rejected KYC means starting the submission process again
						and adds delays, so take the extra minute to get the photograph right.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Profile Setup: Completing Your Account Details</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Beyond basic registration and KYC, a complete Comegame profile includes an accurate address, a
				profile photo (optional but helpful for identity consistency), and fully linked payment methods.
				Taking fifteen minutes to complete all profile fields properly eliminates friction for every
				subsequent platform interaction.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				The address you enter should match the address on your KYC document. Discrepancies are rarely a
				problem if your KYC documents are accepted, but it is cleaner to keep them consistent. Your
				profile email address should be one you actively check — important alerts, including withdrawal
				confirmations and security notifications, arrive there.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Once your profile is complete, take a tour of the platform before playing. Our article explaining
				<a href="/blog/how-comegame-works-features-gameplay-basics" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">how Comegame works and its features</a>
				is a useful companion to this setup guide — it explains what each section of the platform is for
				and how to navigate it efficiently.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Linking Your UPI or Bank Account</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Comegame's primary payment method for Indian users is UPI, supplemented by direct bank transfers
				via NEFT or IMPS for larger amounts. Linking your payment method correctly from the start is critical
				because mismatched or incorrectly formatted payment details are a leading cause of failed withdrawals.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				To link a UPI ID: go to your account settings, find the "Payment Methods" or "Bank Details" section,
				and enter your UPI Virtual Payment Address (VPA) — this looks like yourname@bankshortcode or
				mobilenumber@upi depending on your UPI app. Double-check the full address before saving. Many
				platforms perform a small verification transfer (₹1) to confirm the UPI ID is valid and active.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				To link a bank account directly: you will need your account number, IFSC code, and the account
				holder's name (which must match your Comegame account name). The bank name and branch details
				are usually auto-populated once you enter a valid IFSC code. Use the IFSC finder in your banking
				app if you are unsure of the correct code — entering an incorrect IFSC is a common error that
				causes transfers to fail or go to the wrong bank.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				One important rule: do not link a payment method registered to a different person. The name on your
				bank account or UPI must match the name on your Comegame account and KYC documents. Third-party
				payment methods will be rejected during the withdrawal verification process. This is both a platform
				rule and an anti-fraud measure required by Indian financial regulations.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Security Settings: Protecting Your Account</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Account security on gaming platforms is frequently underestimated. A compromised Comegame account
				can result in stolen wallet funds, misused personal information, and a support resolution process
				that takes weeks. Investing five minutes in security settings at the point of registration is far
				less painful than recovering from a security incident later.
			</p>
			<h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)</h3>
			<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Two-factor authentication adds a second verification step to your login. Even if an attacker has
				your password, they cannot access your account without the OTP sent to your registered mobile
				number. Enable 2FA in your account security settings as soon as you register. Most Comegame-style
				platforms send the second factor via SMS OTP — the same number you registered with.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Never share your 2FA OTP with anyone. Attackers frequently use social engineering — posing as
				platform support, a "lucky draw coordinator," or a "verification agent" — to trick users into
				reading out OTP codes. Legitimate platform processes never require you to share an OTP with a
				human operator.
			</p>
			<h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Password Best Practices</h3>
			<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Your Comegame password should be unique to this platform. Using the same password across multiple
				accounts is one of the highest-risk security habits — when one service is breached, all your
				accounts sharing that password become vulnerable. Use a password manager (such as Bitwarden, which
				is free and open source) to generate and store a strong, unique password for each platform you use.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				A strong password follows this pattern: minimum 12 characters, includes at least one uppercase letter,
				one lowercase letter, one numeral, and one special character (such as !, @, #, or $). Avoid dictionary
				words, names, birth dates, or keyboard patterns like "qwerty123." Change your password if you ever
				suspect your account has been accessed without your knowledge, and immediately after logging in from
				a shared or public device.
			</p>
			<h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Session Security and Device Management</h3>
			<p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Log out of your Comegame account when using a shared device. Most platforms maintain active sessions
				across devices — check your account settings for an "Active Sessions" or "Logged In Devices" section.
				If you see an unfamiliar device or location, revoke that session immediately and change your password.
				Enable account lock after failed login attempts if the platform offers it.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Common Registration Errors and How to Fix Them</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				Even straightforward registration processes throw up errors. Here are the most frequently
				reported issues and their solutions.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-5 space-y-5">
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">OTP Not Received</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						If the registration OTP does not arrive within 60 seconds, first verify the mobile number
						is entered correctly, then tap "Resend OTP." If still not received: check that your
						phone has network signal and SMS-blocking apps (like DND settings or third-party call
						managers) are not filtering the message. Try a different network if available. If the
						issue persists, contact support via the
						<a href="/contact" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Comegame contact page</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">"Mobile Number Already Registered" Error</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						This means an account already exists with your number. Use the "Forgot Password" or "Login"
						option rather than creating a new account. If you genuinely have not registered before,
						someone else may have used your number — contact support immediately to investigate and
						secure the account.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">App Crashes During Registration</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						This is typically a version issue. Update the app to the latest version and retry. Clear
						the app cache if the crash persists. If you installed from an unofficial APK source, the
						file may be corrupted — reinstall from the verified source in our
						<a href="/download-come-games-app" class="text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline">download guide</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">KYC Documents Rejected</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						Rejection reasons are usually specified in the rejection notification: blurry image, name
						mismatch, expired document, or partially visible document. Resubmit with a corrected
						photograph addressing the specific rejection reason. If the rejection reason is a name
						mismatch between your profile and your document, update your profile name first — you
						cannot change KYC document names, only your account profile details.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Unable to Link UPI/Bank Account</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
						Verify the UPI VPA or bank account details are correct and the account is active. Ensure
						the account holder name matches your Comegame profile name exactly. If using a UPI ID,
						confirm the linked bank account is active and not suspended. If the platform performs a
						₹1 verification transfer that fails, check with your bank whether UPI is enabled for
						your account.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">State-Specific Restrictions and Age Verification</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				India's gaming regulatory landscape is governed partly at the state level. Certain states —
				including Telangana, Andhra Pradesh, and Tamil Nadu among others historically — have introduced
				regulations restricting online real-money gaming. Comegame complies with these restrictions, which
				means users from restricted states may find certain features unavailable, including paid competitions
				and deposits.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				State detection is typically done at registration via the mobile number's registered state and,
